ee #childfreebychoice this series was INTENSE. I feel so deeply for the women that have to live with that type of regret and grief. However, I think this is a really important conversation to be had for women, especially living in the patriarchy that we live in. We need to stop idealizing motherhood and start being real with one another about how hard it is and how much it actually impacts your life… AND SIMULTANEOUSLY START CREATING SAFE SPACES FOR EACH OTHER!!! That was one of the reoccurring themes that I noticed in the series women felt like they couldn’t share these things without being shamed and I think that’s really sad! No one should be shamed for how they feel in these scenarios.  I think this is such an interesting topic. I want to hear you guys sound off in the comments, childless women, but also mothers: What are your opinions on this conversation?!! and why do you think it took so long for people to finally start being honest about the realities of motherhood?\",\n        \"createdAt\": \"2026-08-24T22:34:45.000Z\",\n        \"url\": \"https://www.tiktok.com/@thejadareed/video/7677730227849596190\",\n        \"thumbnailUrl\": \"https://p16-common-sign.tiktokcdn-us.com/tos-useast8-p-0068-tx2/o8isMEVPwREiMBABQxWaADpzhayIizozIn5lQ~tplv-tiktokx-cropcenter:500:800.jpeg?biz_tag=musically_video.video_cover&dr=9638&idc=useast5&ps=13740610&refresh_token=5a28dc81&shcp=9b759fb9&shp=c1333099&t=4d5b0474&x-expires=1794002400&x-signature=yVv5HTXbQOY2Aca52NGwHZQF8cI%3D\",\n        \"durationMs\": 234267,\n        \"pinned\": false,\n        \"isAd\": false,\n        \"stats\": {\n          \"views\": 8240,\n          \"likes\": 675,\n          \"comments\": 34,\n          \"shares\": 12,\n          \"saves\": 87\n        },\n        \"media\": {\n          \"downloadUrl\": \"https://v19.tiktokcdn-us.com/21a74013a57436b2b9399bd9db6f28bc/6aee5c77/video/tos/useast8/tos-useast8-ve-0068c002-tx2/oEDZUVUMIBmjhQENqfRjEizEfTzsMAgkgZAvFq/?a=1233&bti=NTY6QGo0QHM6OjZANDQuYCMucCMx